translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "I ran a board meeting today. Flawless, as always."
    new "Hoy dirigí una junta directiva. Impecable, como siempre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "Then you texted, and I answered before the CFO. Priorities."
    new "Luego me escribiste, y te respondí antes que al director financiero. Prioridades."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "I used to give every order in this house."
    new "Antes yo daba todas las órdenes en esta casa."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "Now I wait for yours. I'm still learning to say that out loud."
    new "Ahora espero las tuyas. Todavía estoy aprendiendo a decirlo en voz alta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "Your father thinks I've mellowed."
    new "Tu padre cree que me he suavizado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "Let him. Only you know what actually happened to me."
    new "Que lo crea. Solo tú sabes lo que de verdad me pasó."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "I checked your account this morning."
    new "Revisé tu cuenta esta mañana."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "It was too low. I fixed it. Don't argue."
    new "El saldo estaba demasiado bajo. Lo arreglé. No discutas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "Money is the one language I've always spoken fluently."
    new "El dinero es el único idioma que siempre he hablado con fluidez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "So let me spend it on you. It says what I can't."
    new "Así que déjame gastarlo en ti. Dice lo que yo no puedo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "I once bought a company because it annoyed me."
    new "Una vez compré una empresa porque me molestaba."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "Spoiling you is a better investment. The returns are immediate."
    new "Consentirte es una mejor inversión. El retorno es inmediato."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "At dinner I'll be the strict stepmother again."
    new "En la cena volveré a ser la madrastra estricta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "Frown back at me. Your father notices everything except the truth."
    new "Devuélveme el ceño fruncido. Tu padre se da cuenta de todo menos de la verdad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "I scolded you in front of him yesterday. Theater."
    new "Ayer te regañé frente a él. Teatro."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "...You played along beautifully, by the way."
    new "...Por cierto, me seguiste el juego de maravilla."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "He tells his friends I keep you in line."
    new "Les cuenta a sus amigos que yo te mantengo a raya."

    # game/scripts/Chat/shion_chitchat.rpy:31
    old "He's not wrong. He just has the direction backwards."
    new "No se equivoca. Solo entendió la dirección al revés."

